                  "feedback": {
                    "en": "15 repeats over and over. What kind of number repeats a block?",
                    "hi": "15 बार-बार दोहराता है। जो संख्या एक हिस्सा दोहराए, वह किस तरह की है?"
                  },
                  "misconception": "patternMeansRecurring"
                },
                {
                  "id": "growing",
                  "label": {
                    "en": "0.150150015000150…",
                    "hi": "0.150150015000150…"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "tooBig",
                  "label": {
                    "en": "0.3010010001…",
                    "hi": "0.3010010001…"
                  },
                  "feedback": {
                    "en": "It's irrational, but is it less than 2/7 = 0.2857…?",
                    "hi": "यह अपरिमेय तो है, पर क्या यह 2/7 = 0.2857… से कम है?"
                  },
                  "misconception": "ignoresInterval"
                }
              ],
              "answer": "growing",
              "concepts": [
                "irrational-decimals"
              ],
              "speak": {
                "en": "1 seventh is 0.142857 and so on, and 2 sevenths is 0.285714 and so on. Which is an irrational number between them?",
                "hi": "1 बटा 7 बराबर 0.142857 और आगे, और 2 बटा 7 बराबर 0.285714 और आगे। इनके बीच कौन-सी अपरिमेय संख्या है?"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "name": "arjunBuild",
            "kind": "prop",
            "isHidden": true,
            "prop": "line",
            "with": {
              "character": "arjun",
              "line": {
                "en": "It starts 0.15, so it sits between them, and its 0s keep growing, so no block repeats. You can build as many as you like this way.",
                "hi": "यह 0.15 से शुरू होती है, इसलिए दोनों के बीच है, और इसके 0 बढ़ते रहते हैं, इसलिए कोई हिस्सा नहीं दोहराता। ऐसे जितनी चाहो उतनी बना सकते हो।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 5,
            "name": "rest",
            "kind": "space"
